#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:625
msgid ""
"When you enter code 'a', besides the character for 'a', candidates starting "
"with 'a' are also shown, e.g. entries like '式a 节b'."
msgstr ""
"当你录入编码a时，除显示a对应的“工”字外，\n"
"极点还会提示所有编码以a开头的字和词组，\n"
"如：“式a 节b”等。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:627
msgid "Output Simplified Chinese characters."
msgstr "输出简体汉字。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:628
msgid "Output Traditional Chinese characters."
msgstr "输出繁体汉字。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:629
msgid "Use the GB2312 character set; status bar displays GB."
msgstr "使用 GB2312 字符集，状态栏显示 GB。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:630
msgid "Use the GB18030 character set; status bar displays GBK."
msgstr "使用 GB18030 字符集，状态栏显示 GBK。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:631
msgid "Type with Wubi codes."
msgstr "使用五笔编码输入。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:632
msgid "Type with Pinyin."
msgstr "使用拼音输入。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:633
msgid "Combine Wubi and Pinyin input."
msgstr "五笔与拼音结合输入。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:635
msgid ""
"When editing Word documents, paragraph indents of two Chinese characters can "
"be entered conveniently with this option."
msgstr ""
"在编辑WORD文档时，段首通常要缩进2\n"
"个汉字位置，选用此项可以方便的实现此\n"
"功能。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:637
msgid ""
"When enabled, after typing '中', related phrases such as '中国' and '中国共产"
"党' are listed for selection."
msgstr ""
"启用此项，当你输入“中”后极点会列出\n"
"“中国”、“中国共产党”等相关词供选择。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:639
msgid ""
"When enabled, paired punctuation can be entered with the opening mark; e.g. "
"'(' outputs '()' and places the cursor inside. Press Enter to finish."
msgstr ""
"启用此功能后，成对标点按前面一个即可输入\n"
"一对。如按（极点输出（）并将光标置于其中，\n"
"回车结束输入。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:642
msgid ""
"When enabled, if a phrase exists in the lexicon but you type it character by "
"character, you are prompted. If ignored repeatedly, the phrase may be hidden "
"depending on Advanced settings."
msgstr ""
"选中此项，如词库中有“中国”一词，但你以\n"
"单字方式来录入，系统会提示你。如果提示多\n"
"次你仍不用此词组，则此词组会自动隐藏，是\n"
"否隐藏由“高级设置”中的“智能隐藏词组”选项\n"
"决定。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:645
msgid ""
"When enabled, an alert sounds when the code is empty or has duplicate "
"candidates."
msgstr ""
"选中此项，当你录入空码或有重码时，\n"
"极点会发声提示你。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:646
msgid "When enabled, alerts use sound files in the Freewb sound directory."
msgstr ""
"选中此项，报警时将使用极点sound目录\n"
"中的声音文件。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:648
msgid ""
"The selected duplicate candidate is moved to the first position.\n"
"Note: single characters are not adjusted this way; use Ctrl+number instead."
msgstr ""
"有重码时被选择的候选项自动调位至首位。\n"
"【注】单字不参与这种调频，而只能以Ctrl+\n"
"序号的方式调整。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:652
msgid ""
"When enabled, Shift+letter outputs the letter directly; otherwise temporary "
"English mode is used and Enter commits the text."
msgstr ""
"选中此项，Shift＋字母直接输出字母，\n"
"否则转到临时英文状态，按回车后输出\n"
"所输入的英文并返回中文输入状态。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:654
msgid "When enabled, typing speed is tracked in real time."
msgstr "启用此项，极点会实时统计你的打字速度信息。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:655
msgid "Your computer behaves like a typewriter (useful for Wubi beginners)."
msgstr ""
"你的计算机就像一台打字机（五笔新手学习时\n"
"可以使用此功能）。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:656
msgid ""
"When enabled, duplicate or empty codes output the first two candidates or "
"codes for batch proofreading."
msgstr ""
"选中此项，当重码或空码时极点会同时输入前2\n"
"个候选项或编码，供批量校对时参考。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:658
msgid ""
"When enabled, consecutive single-character commits form auto phrases; "
"selected auto phrases are saved to the auto phrase lexicon."
msgstr ""
"选中此项，连续以单字方式上屏可形成自动词组；\n"
"选中的词组会保存到自动词组词库。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:661
msgid ""
"When enabled, the Wubi engine loads zz special encoding symbols from the mb "
"table."
msgstr "启用该功能时，五笔字型引擎会从码表文件中加载zz特殊编码符号"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:663
msgid ""
"When typing URLs such as 'www.freewb.org', entering 'www.' switches to "
"English so browser autocomplete can be used."
msgstr ""
"如我们上网时常常输入“www.freewb.org”\n"
"这样的网址，当你在极点中输入“www.”\n"
"时，极点会自动转到英文状态，这样可以充分\n"
"利用浏览器的自动完成功能，快速输入要浏览\n"
"的网址，非常方便。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:665
msgid ""
"For numbers like '12,345.9', enter half-width ',.' here to input grouped "
"numbers without wrong full-width punctuation."
msgstr ""
"财务人员常要输入“12,345.9”这样带\n"
"分节符的数字，把半角的“,.”填到此框中\n"
"就可以方便输入这类数字了，而不用担心出现\n"
"“12，345，678。9”这样的结果。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:668
msgid "Shows installed skins; select one to change the appearance."
msgstr ""
"点击此按钮将显示已安装的皮肤名称，可以在\n"
"此处选择更换皮肤。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:669
msgid ""
"When enabled, the toolbar is placed at the top-right of the active window. "
"Drag it elsewhere if you prefer another corner."
msgstr ""
"选中此项，极点会将状态栏自动定位于当前窗\n"
"口的右上角，方便用户操作。注：如果你习惯\n"
"状态栏定位于左下角，取消此选项并将状态栏\n"
"拖到你希望的位置即可。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:671
msgid "Opens a drop-down menu."
msgstr "点击此钮显示下拉菜单。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:672
msgid ""
"When enabled, hidden toolbar buttons expand on mouse hover and collapse when "
"the pointer leaves."
msgstr ""
"选中此项，鼠标移至状态栏时，状态栏会自动\n"
"展开隐藏部分，方便选择上面的功能按钮。鼠\n"
"标移开后，展开部分自动隐藏。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:674
msgid "When enabled, toolbar and candidate window actions play sound effects."
msgstr ""
"选中此项后，对极点状态栏或候选窗进行操作\n"
"时，会有声音提示。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:675
msgid "When enabled, brief help is shown when hovering toolbar buttons."
msgstr "选中此项，鼠标移到状态栏按钮上时会显示简要帮助。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:676
msgid "Hide the toolbar in games or fullscreen apps to reduce distraction."
msgstr "游戏或全屏软件，为减少状态栏干扰可以启用此项。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:677
msgid "Adjust toolbar transparency."
msgstr "此处用于调整状态栏的透明度。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:679
msgid "Choose single-row, double-row, or multi-row candidate window layout."
msgstr ""
"点击此按钮在显示的下拉菜单中可以选择单行\n"
"候选窗、双行候选窗和方形多行候选窗。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:680
msgid "Change the separator between index and candidate text."
msgstr "此处可以更换候选项与序号间隔符。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:681
msgid "Use a gradient background for the candidate window."
msgstr "选择此项后，使用渐变背景色为候选窗背景。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:682
msgid "Use an image as the candidate window background."
msgstr "选择此项后，使用图片为候选窗背景。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:683
msgid "Tile the background image; otherwise stretch it to fill the window."
msgstr "选择此项后，平铺图片为候选窗背景，否则拉伸图片为候选窗背景。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:684
msgid "Set the corner radius of the candidate window."
msgstr "此处用于设置候选窗的圆弧角度。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:685
msgid "Set candidate window transparency."
msgstr "此处用于设置候选窗的透明度。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:687
msgid ""
"Number of candidates shown; larger values mean fewer page turns (balance "
"with appearance)."
msgstr ""
"候选窗中可供选择的候选项的个数，数值越大，\n"
"可供候选的项数越多，翻页的可能性越小\n"
"〖以美观为宜〗。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:688
msgid ""
"Maximum characters per candidate; very small values show '...' for hidden "
"text."
msgstr ""
"每个候选项中最多能显示在候选窗上的字数，\n"
"如果数值设置的过小，则候选窗中会以...的形式\n"
"显示隐藏的部分。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:690
msgid "Open font settings for candidate text."
msgstr "单击打开字体设置界面进行字体、字号设置。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:691
msgid "Set candidate window background color or image."
msgstr "单击设置候选窗背景色(背景图)。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:692
msgid "Set the gradient start color."
msgstr "单击设置候选窗背景渐变起始色。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:693
msgid "Set the gradient end color."
msgstr "单击设置候选窗背景渐变截止色。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:694
msgid "Set the candidate window border color."
msgstr "单击设置候选窗边框色。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:695
msgid "Set the color for auto-generated brief codes."
msgstr "单击设置候选窗自动词颜色，突出显示简码字。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:696
msgid "Set the candidate window prompt text color."
msgstr "单击设置极点候选窗提示信息颜色。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:698
msgid "Key to select the 2nd candidate, e.g. ',' for users who prefer comma."
msgstr ""
"设定选择第2候选项的键，如有些用户习惯用\n"
"“,”来选择第二候选项，那么，在相应框中填\n"
"入英文的“,”即可。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:699
msgid "Key to select the 3rd candidate, e.g. '.' for users who prefer period."
msgstr ""
"设定选择第3候选项的键，如有些用户习惯用\n"
"“.”来选择第三候选项，那么，在相应框中填入\n"
"英文的“.”即可。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:700
msgid ""
"When enabled, the candidate window follows the caret; otherwise it stays at "
"the bottom (or drag it anywhere)."
msgstr ""
"选择此项，候选窗会定位于光标附近，否则候\n"
"选窗定位于屏幕底部(也可用鼠标将其拖到任\n"
"意位置)。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:702
msgid ""
"Show operation hints at the bottom of the multi-row candidate window, e.g. "
"'Ctrl+= add word online'."
msgstr ""
"选择此项后，会在方形候选窗底部出现极点的\n"
"提示信息。如提示：【Ctrl+=实时加词】"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:705
msgid ""
"When enabled, Left Shift selects the 2nd candidate and Right Shift the 3rd. "
"Swap in Expert settings if needed."
msgstr ""
"选中此项，可用左Shift键选第2候选项，\n"
"右Shift键选取第3候选项。如果要用\n"
"右Shift选第2英，左Shift选第3项，\n"
"请到专家设置模式中改。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:707
msgid "Previous page key, e.g. ',' if you prefer comma and period for paging."
msgstr ""
"设定候选项翻页的键，如有些用户习惯用“,”\n"
"和“.”来前翻和后翻页，那么，在相应框中填入\n"
"英文的“,”和“.”即可。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:708
msgid "Next page key, e.g. '.' if you prefer comma and period for paging."
msgstr ""
"设定候选项翻页的键，如有些用户习惯用“,”\n"
"和“.”来前翻和后翻页，那么，在相应框中填入\n"
"英文的“,”和“.”即可。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:709
msgid "Keys for selecting 2nd and 3rd duplicate candidates."
msgstr "设定选择第2，３重码的按键。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:710
msgid "Keys for candidate paging."
msgstr "设定候选词翻页的按键。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:711
msgid "Show dictionary lookup when hovering candidates."
msgstr "选中此项，鼠标悬停候选词时可显示字典释义。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:713
msgid ""
"Select a Freewb function such as reverse lookup or online word creation."
msgstr ""
"此下拉框用于选择极点功能，如：反查编码、\n"
"在线造词等。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:714
msgid "Shortcut for the function selected above."
msgstr "用于设定上面功能的快捷键。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:715
msgid ""
"Disable all Freewb shortcuts to avoid conflicts with other applications."
msgstr ""
"为解决极点与应用软件快捷键冲突，可以用\n"
"此项禁用所有极点的快捷键。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:717
msgid ""
"Shift+Space is the default full/half width shortcut in Fcitx; enable this to "
"disable it."
msgstr ""
"〖SHIFT+空格〗这组快捷键是由FCITX\n"
"控制的大多数输入法默认的全半角切换快捷键，\n"
"如果要禁用此功能，请选中此项。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:718
msgid ""
"For short English input (e.g. email), press this key then type English and "
"press Enter to return to Chinese. Also used as a lead key for advanced "
"features."
msgstr ""
"当你需要录入小段英文时（如邮箱或邮址）按\n"
"此键，之后录入英文按回车输出并返回中文；\n"
"同时临时英文键也是极点许多高级功能的引导键，\n"
"详细内容参见极点使用说明中的变量说明部分。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:720
msgid ""
"Press this key, then a letter to output a predefined phrase.\n"
"Custom rules: %1\n"
"(Right-click toolbar → Management tools → Edit shortcut table)."
msgstr ""
"单击此键后再输入一个字母，可输出事先自定义的一个短语。\n"
"自定义的规则详见%1文件\n"
"（右击状态栏→管理工具→编辑快捷码表可快速打开此文件）。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:723
msgid ""
"When in Wubi mode, press this key for temporary Pinyin input of unknown "
"characters, then return to Wubi. With code already typed, toggles rare-"
"character mode."
msgstr ""
"如果你的极点状态栏上显示的汉字是“五笔字型”，\n"
"则遇到不会拆分的单字或词组时可以按此键，极点会\n"
"转到拼音状态，输完后自动转回五笔状态。 已经输\n"
"入了编码时也可以按这个键，这时极点会在临时生僻\n"
"字与正常输入状态之间切换。"

#: src/panel/src/settingwin.cpp:725
msgid ""
"Choose a key to switch Chinese/English without closing or switching the "
"input method."
msgstr ""
"从下拉列表中选择一个按键，可通过单击不用\n"
"关闭或切换输入法而实现中英文状态的快速\n"
"切换。"

